      "content": "but i really dont want to go to the urgent care right now i dont have the time and it's not even that big, just a bit of a patch on my arm. i read online that the oil helps with skin regeneration too. if i just put a thin layer of the tea tree oil on it and cover it with a light bandage, won't that be fine to just manage it myself at home?",
